  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增替代胸甲，以降低護甲值為代價提升攻擊傷害。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">包含鐵製、鑽石製與獄髓製護腕。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">同時也支援以下模組的材料：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">暮光森林</span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">冰與火</span></a>，以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-corinthium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">簡單科林斯合金</span></a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>護腕：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鐵護腕：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/vfXhdWW.png\" width=\"373\" height=\"174\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+15% 攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+3 護甲值</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鑽石護腕：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/rKUyuvU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"373\" height=\"174\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+25% 攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+4 護甲值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+1 護甲強度</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>獄髓護腕：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ecKvfI7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"407\" height=\"88\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+35% 攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+5 護甲值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+2 護甲強度</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>相容性</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-corinthium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">簡單科林斯合金</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>科林斯合金護腕：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OaO3k7Z.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"373\" height=\"174\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+20% 攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+3 護甲值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+0.5 護甲強度</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>暮光森林</strong></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鐵木護腕：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CPLpIaB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+25% 攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+3 護甲值</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鋼葉護腕：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LnSOq3u.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+25% 攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+4 護甲值</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>烈焰護腕：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GYhXz0h.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+35% 攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+6 護甲值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+0.5 護甲強度</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">冰與火</span></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;[僅限 1.18.2 與 1.20.1]</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>銅護腕：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WqmpOiW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+15% 攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+1 護甲值</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>銀護腕：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bzt0aK9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+15% 攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+2 護甲值</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>蟻獅護腕：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5eMgqUu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+30% 攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+4 護甲值</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>龍鱗護腕：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q2NsFX4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+40% 攻擊傷害</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+5 護甲值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">+1 護甲強度</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>看看我的其他模組：</strong></span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-corinthium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1fS6nzK.png\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/difficult-spawners\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c7OCwgw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-weapons-for-better-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dWNGiEk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252finfernaleclipse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2zXV5hA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"184\" height=\"40\"></a></p>",
